steps.prompt:
Route check: {from_name} to {to_name}.
Routing status: {route.status}
Routing error (if any): {route.error}
Active road blocks: {route.active_blocks}
Blocks crossed by the normal route: {route.blocks_on_normal_route}
Normal route: {route.normal_minutes} min, {route.normal_km} km
Route avoiding active blocks: {route.detour_minutes} min, {route.detour_km} km
Delay from avoiding blocks: {route.delay_minutes} min

Write 2-3 sentences for a control-room dispatcher. If routing status is Error, say in one sentence that the route could not be calculated and why, and stop. Otherwise: say whether the normal route passes through an active block zone (name them), state the extra time and distance of the safe route, and give one practical dispatch consideration that follows directly from those figures. Times are free-flow driving estimates from OpenRouteService and exclude live traffic; mention this briefly.
